{"seq":2,"slug":"nuxt-fundamentals","title":"Nuxt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-fundamentals","wordCount":548,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"nuxt-基础\">Nuxt 基础</h1><h2 id=\"全栈-vue-框架\">全栈 Vue 框架</h2><p>Nuxt 3 是基于 Vue 3 的全栈框架，提供文件系统路由、自动导入、SSR/SSG 支持等开箱即用的功能。它基于 Nitro 服务引擎和 Vite 构建工具，是构建现代 Vue 应用的最佳选择之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Nuxt[&quot;Nuxt 3 架构&quot;]&#10;        Vue[&quot;Vue 3&quot;] --&gt; Nuxt3[&quot;Nuxt Core&quot;]&#10;        Vite[&quot;Vite&quot;] --&gt; Nuxt3&#10;        Nitro[&quot;Nitro Server&quot;] --&gt; Nuxt3&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Features[&quot;核心特性&quot;]&#10;        FR[&quot;文件系统路由&quot;]&#10;        AI[&quot;自动导入&quot;]&#10;        SSR[&quot;SSR / SSG / ISR&quot;]&#10;        API[&quot;服务端 API&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Nuxt --&gt; Features\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Nuxt[\"Nuxt 3 架构\"]\n        Vue[\"Vue 3\"] --&gt; Nuxt3[\"Nuxt Core\"]\n        Vite[\"Vite\"] --&gt; Nuxt3\n        Nitro[\"Nitro Server\"] --&gt; Nuxt3\n    end\n    subgraph Features[\"核心特性\"]\n        FR[\"文件系统路由\"]\n        AI[\"自动导入\"]\n        SSR[\"SSR / SSG / ISR\"]\n        API[\"服务端 API\"]\n    end\n    Nuxt --&gt; Features</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>全栈框架</strong>：Nuxt 把 Vue 3、Vite、Nitro 组合为统一开发体验，同时负责客户端与服务端。</li>\n<li><strong>文件系统路由</strong>：<code>pages/</code> 目录结构即路由表，文件名约定（<code>[id]</code>、<code>[...slug]</code>、<code>[[id]]</code>）决定动态参数形态。</li>\n<li><strong>自动导入</strong>：Vue API、composable、组件与工具函数按约定目录自动注册，减少样板代码。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染模式</strong>：SSR / SSG / ISR 等由框架统一调度，是 Nuxt 区别于纯前端框架的核心能力。</li>\n<li><strong>Runtime Config</strong>：区分 <code>public</code> 与私有配置，私有项只在服务端可见，用于安全管理环境变量。</li>\n<li><strong>模块（Module）</strong>：生态扩展单元，一行配置即可接入 Pinia、Tailwind、Image 等能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统路由\">文件系统路由</h2><p>Nuxt 基于 <code>pages/</code> 目录的文件结构自动生成路由：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件路径</th>\n<th>生成路由</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pages/index.vue</code></td>\n<td><code>/</code></td>\n<td>首页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pages/about.vue</code></td>\n<td><code>/about</code></td>\n<td>静态路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pages/blog/[id].vue</code></td>\n<td><code>/blog/:id</code></td>\n<td>动态参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pages/blog/[...slug].vue</code></td>\n<td><code>/blog/*</code></td>\n<td>捕获所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pages/user/[[id]].vue</code></td>\n<td><code>/user/:id?</code></td>\n<td>可选参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"pages/&#10;├── index.vue           → /&#10;├── about.vue           → /about&#10;├── blog/&#10;│   ├── index.vue       → /blog&#10;│   └── [id].vue        → /blog/:id&#10;├── user/&#10;│   └── [id]/&#10;│       ├── index.vue   → /user/:id&#10;│       └── settings.vue→ /user/:id/settings&#10;└── [...slug].vue       → 404 catch-all\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── index.vue           → /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── about.vue           → /about</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── blog/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── index.vue       → /blog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── [id].vue        → /blog/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── user/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── [id]/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── index.vue   → /user/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── settings.vue→ /user/:id/settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── [...slug].vue       → 404 catch-all</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- pages/blog/[id].vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const route = useRoute();&#10;const id = route.params.id as string;&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;article&gt;&#10;    &lt;h1&gt;文章 #{{ id }}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;  &lt;/article&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- pages/blog/[id].vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const route = useRoute();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const id = route.params.id as string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h1>文章 #{{ id }}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动导入\">自动导入</h2><p>Nuxt 自动导入 Vue API、composable 和组件，无需手动 import：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;// ✅ 无需 import { ref, computed } from &#39;vue&#39;&#10;const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;const doubled = computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2);&#10;&#10;// ✅ 无需 import { useRoute } from &#39;vue-router&#39;&#10;const route = useRoute();&#10;&#10;// ✅ composables/ 目录下的函数自动导入&#10;const { data } = useFetch(&#39;/api/posts&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 无需 import { ref, computed } from 'vue'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const count = ref&#x3C;number>(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const doubled = computed(() => count.value * 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 无需 import { useRoute } from 'vue-router'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const route = useRoute();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ composables/ 目录下的函数自动导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data } = useFetch('/api/posts');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动导入的范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>导入内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>vue</code></td>\n<td><code>ref</code>、<code>computed</code>、<code>watch</code> 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vue-router</code></td>\n<td><code>useRoute</code>、<code>useRouter</code> 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>composables/</code></td>\n<td>自定义 composable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>utils/</code></td>\n<td>工具函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>components/</code></td>\n<td>Vue 组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nuxt 内置</td>\n<td><code>useFetch</code>、<code>useAsyncData</code>、<code>useState</code> 等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"目录结构\">目录结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"nuxt-app/&#10;├── app.vue              # 应用入口&#10;├── nuxt.config.ts       # Nuxt 配置&#10;├── pages/               # 页面（文件系统路由）&#10;├── components/          # 组件（自动导入）&#10;├── composables/         # Composable（自动导入）&#10;├── layouts/             # 布局组件&#10;├── middleware/           # 路由中间件&#10;├── plugins/             # 插件&#10;├── server/              # 服务端 API&#10;│   ├── api/             # API 路由&#10;│   └── middleware/      # 服务端中间件&#10;├── public/              # 静态资源&#10;├── assets/              # 需要构建的资源&#10;└── utils/               # 工具函数（自动导入）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nuxt-app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── app.vue              # 应用入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── nuxt.config.ts       # Nuxt 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pages/               # 页面（文件系统路由）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── components/          # 组件（自动导入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── composables/         # Composable（自动导入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── layouts/             # 布局组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── middleware/           # 路由中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── plugins/             # 插件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── server/              # 服务端 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── api/             # API 路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── middleware/      # 服务端中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── public/              # 静态资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── assets/              # 需要构建的资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── utils/               # 工具函数（自动导入）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"nuxt-模块\">Nuxt 模块</h2><p>Nuxt 模块扩展框架的能力，是社区生态的核心：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  modules: [&#39;@pinia/nuxt&#39;, &#39;@nuxtjs/tailwindcss&#39;, &#39;@vueuse/nuxt&#39;, &#39;@nuxt/image&#39;, &#39;@nuxt/content&#39;],&#10;&#10;  pinia: {&#10;    storesDirs: [&#39;./stores/**&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  modules: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@pinia/nuxt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@nuxtjs/tailwindcss'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@vueuse/nuxt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@nuxt/image'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@nuxt/content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pinia: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    storesDirs: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./stores/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常用模块</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@pinia/nuxt</code></td>\n<td>Pinia 状态管理集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@nuxtjs/tailwindcss</code></td>\n<td>Tailwind CSS 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@vueuse/nuxt</code></td>\n<td>VueUse 自动导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@nuxt/image</code></td>\n<td>图片优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@nuxt/content</code></td>\n<td>内容管理（Markdown）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@nuxtjs/i18n</code></td>\n<td>国际化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"runtime-config\">Runtime Config</h2><p>使用运行时配置安全地管理环境变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  runtimeConfig: {&#10;    dbPassword: process.env.DB_PASSWORD,&#10;    apiSecret: process.env.API_SECRET,&#10;    public: {&#10;      apiBase: process.env.NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE ?? &#39;/api&#39;,&#10;      appName: &#39;My App&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  runtimeConfig: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dbPassword: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    apiSecret: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">API_SECRET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    public: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      apiBase: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      appName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'My App'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 客户端组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const config = useRuntimeConfig();&#10;&#10;// ✅ 客户端只能访问 public 配置&#10;console.log(config.public.apiBase);&#10;console.log(config.public.appName);&#10;&#10;// ❌ 私有配置在客户端不可用&#10;// console.log(config.dbPassword) → undefined&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 客户端组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const config = useRuntimeConfig();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 客户端只能访问 public 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(config.public.apiBase);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(config.public.appName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 私有配置在客户端不可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// console.log(config.dbPassword) → undefined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// server/api/data.ts — 服务端可以访问所有配置&#10;export default defineEventHandler(() =&gt; {&#10;  const config = useRuntimeConfig();&#10;  console.log(config.apiSecret);&#10;  console.log(config.public.apiBase);&#10;  return { status: &#39;ok&#39; };&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// server/api/data.ts — 服务端可以访问所有配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineEventHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRuntimeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.apiSecret);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.public.apiBase);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ok'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    RC[&quot;runtimeConfig&quot;]&#10;    RC --&gt; Private[&quot;私有配置&lt;br/&gt;(仅服务端)&quot;]&#10;    RC --&gt; Public[&quot;public 配置&lt;br/&gt;(客户端 + 服务端)&quot;]&#10;    Private --&gt; Server[&quot;server/ 目录&quot;]&#10;    Public --&gt; Client[&quot;pages / components&quot;]&#10;    Public --&gt; Server\">flowchart TD\n    RC[\"runtimeConfig\"]\n    RC --&gt; Private[\"私有配置&lt;br/&gt;(仅服务端)\"]\n    RC --&gt; Public[\"public 配置&lt;br/&gt;(客户端 + 服务端)\"]\n    Private --&gt; Server[\"server/ 目录\"]\n    Public --&gt; Client[\"pages / components\"]\n    Public --&gt; Server</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"布局系统\">布局系统</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- layouts/default.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div&gt;&#10;    &lt;AppHeader /&gt;&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;    &lt;AppFooter /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- layouts/default.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AppHeader /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AppFooter /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- pages/admin.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;definePageMeta({&#10;  layout: &#39;admin&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- pages/admin.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>definePageMeta({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  layout: 'admin',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Nuxt 3 基于 Vue 3 + Vite + Nitro，提供全栈开发体验</li>\n<li><strong>文件系统路由</strong>根据 <code>pages/</code> 目录结构自动生成路由，支持动态参数和嵌套</li>\n<li><strong>自动导入</strong>覆盖 Vue API、composable、组件和工具函数，减少样板代码</li>\n<li><strong>模块生态</strong>提供丰富的扩展，一行配置即可集成</li>\n<li><code>runtimeConfig</code> 区分公开/私有配置，安全管理环境变量</li>\n<li>布局系统通过 <code>layouts/</code> 目录和 <code>definePageMeta</code> 实现灵活的页面布局切换</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nuxt 基础","id":"nuxt-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"全栈 Vue 框架","id":"全栈-vue-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文件系统路由","id":"文件系统路由"},{"level":2,"text":"自动导入","id":"自动导入"},{"level":2,"text":"目录结构","id":"目录结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Nuxt 模块","id":"nuxt-模块"},{"level":2,"text":"Runtime Config","id":"runtime-config"},{"level":2,"text":"布局系统","id":"布局系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Vue Router 进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/vue-router-advanced"},"next":{"title":"Nuxt 数据获取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-data-fetching"}}